              <div class="text-container">
                <span class="span-title">What is SBST?</span>
                <p class="span-subtitle">A cooperative project of concerned individual Christians, interested Baptist Associations, 
                  Baptist Churches in Metro Manila, and friends of the Bible school; meeting at the facilities 
                  provided by the International Baptist Church of Manila in Salcedo Village Makati City, Philippines. 
                  The Bible school is an associate member of the Luzon Convention of Southern Baptist Churches and 
                  recognized by the Federation of Southern Baptist Conventions of the Philippines.</p>
              </div>
